   "id": "17b193d5",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# Netflix Titles — Exploratory Data Analysis\n",
    "\n",
    "**Goal:** Explore the Netflix titles catalog using a structured EDA workflow and turn the findings into clear business insights.\n",
    "\n",
    "### Questions this notebook answers\n",
    "1. What does the dataset look like and where are the data-quality issues?\n",
    "2. How is the catalog split between Movies and TV Shows?\n",
    "3. What ratings and release years dominate the catalog?\n",
    "4. How do Movie durations and TV Show seasons behave?\n",
    "5. How did Netflix title additions change over time?\n",
    "6. How do Movies and TV Shows differ by rating and release year?\n",
    "7. What potential outliers exist, and should they be removed?\n",
    "8. What business insights and recommendations can be derived?\n",
    "\n",
    "> **EDA workflow:** **Load → Understand → Clean → Univariate → Bivariate → Outliers → Insights → Recommendations**.\n"
   ]
  },
