    "## 4. Data Cleaning\n",
    "\n",
    "For this exploratory project:\n",
    "- Missing text/categorical attributes are represented as `Unknown`.\n",
    "- `date_added` is converted to datetime after trimming whitespace.\n",
    "- Original `duration` is retained while analysis-ready numeric fields are created for Movies and TV Shows.\n"
   ]
